{"title": "Faceless Masquerade", "pageid": 30390, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Faceless_Masquerade", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Faceless Masquerade</b> is a passive feature that enhances the user's deception and persuasion ability.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png/25px-Deception_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png/38px-Deception_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png/50px-Deception_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deception\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png/25px-Deception_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png/25px-Persuasion_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png/38px-Persuasion_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png/50px-Persuasion_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Persuasion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png/25px-Persuasion_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mutilated_Carapace\" title=\"Mutilated Carapace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Mutilated_Carapace_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\